# disturb.scn — P7 disturbance & recovery (wind gust + motor fault) on emu_vehicle
# P7 外乱と回復（風の突風＋モータ劣化）旧ファーム emu_vehicle
#
# Builds on hover_alt.scn's airborne ALTITUDE_HOLD hover, then injects two
# disturbances and checks the controller recovers (G3: attitude/altitude bounded,
# returns toward the setpoint) and stays within actuator limits (G4: low saturation).
# Both disturbances are SUSTAINED STEPS applied at an instant BETWEEN rc holds, so the
# 50 Hz rc stream never pauses (a long pause would trip the ESP-NOW failsafe). A gust
# is two events — set, then later clear — with an rc hold in between providing its
# duration; the firmware flies through the disturbance the whole time.
#
# hover_alt.scn の空中 ALT_HOLD ホバーを土台に、2つの外乱を注入し制御の回復を確認する
# （G3: 姿勢/高度が有界で setpoint へ戻る、G4: 飽和率が低い）。外乱は rc ホールドの「間」の
# 一瞬に持続ステップとして与え、50Hz rc 列を途切れさせない（長い無通信は ESP-NOW failsafe）。
# 突風は2イベント（設定→後でクリア）で、間の rc ホールドが継続時間を与える。
#
# Run: sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/disturb.scn --duration 45000000
#
#  <t>  ch    <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  0     13000     50              # A: disarmed 13 s (boot→IDLE before ARM edge)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50              # B: ARM rising edge in IDLE
   +    rc    3310  2048   2048    2048  1     2600      50              # C: STABILIZE gentle take-off to ~0.62 m
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     4000      50        1      # D: ALT_HOLD capture + settle 4 s (clean baseline)
#  --- Disturbance 1: LATERAL wind gust (horizontal force only — altitude-safe) ---
#  A purely horizontal force never threatens altitude (no vertical component) and
#  applies no torque, so attitude stays level and ALT_HOLD holds — the craft drifts
#  in +x (no position hold) but altitude & attitude stay BOUNDED (G3). A SHORT pulse
#  (1.5 s hold) keeps the drift small. Vertical gusts at the low 0.62 m hover have too
#  little margin and land the craft, so wind here is lateral only.
#  純水平力は高度を脅かさず（垂直成分なし）トルクも与えないので姿勢は水平・ALT_HOLD は保持。
#  +x にドリフト（位置保持なし）するが高度・姿勢は有界（G3）。短いパルス(1.5s)でドリフト小。
   +    wind  0.05  0.0    0.0                                           # E: gust ON — 0.05 N forward (NED), lateral only
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50        1      # F: hover UNDER lateral gust 1.5 s → drifts +x, altitude/attitude held
   +    wind  0.0   0.0    0.0                                           # G: gust OFF
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1      # H: coast/settle 3 s (level, altitude held)
#  --- Disturbance 2: motor 0 (M1 FR) degraded to 70% thrust (THE attitude recovery test) ---
#  Asymmetric thrust applies a roll/pitch torque; the mixer raises the other motors and
#  the attitude loop returns the craft to level (recovery), altitude held by the mixer.
#  非対称推力がロール/ピッチトルクを与える→ミキサーが他モータを上げ姿勢ループが水平へ復帰、
#  高度はミキサーが維持。これが本命の姿勢回復テスト。
   +    fault 0     0.75                                                 # I: motor fault — 75% thrust on M1 FR (25% loss)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     5000      50        1      # J: hover UNDER fault 5 s → attitude perturbs then recovers, bounded
   +    fault 0     1.0                                                  # K: motor restored
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     7000      50        1      # L: recover 7 s → tilt returns toward level, altitude held (END in recovered hover)
#
# Ends in a recovered hover ON PURPOSE (no descent/landing): P7 is a DISTURBANCE-
# RECOVERY demo, and a ground touchdown adds a stiff-contact tip-over that dominates
# the attitude axis and hides the in-flight ~12° fault response. Stopping airborne
# keeps the review video's roll/pitch axis scaled to the actual disturbance.
# 回復ホバーで終える（降下/着地なし）: P7 は外乱回復のデモで、接地は剛体接触の転倒を生み
# 姿勢軸を支配し飛行中の ~12° 故障応答を隠す。空中で止め姿勢軸を外乱本来の範囲に保つ。
#
# Expectation (G3/G4, read from trajectory.csv):
#   F: a downward+fwd wind makes alt dip briefly, then ALT_HOLD raises thrust and holds
#      (alt returns to within a few cm of the ~0.62 m setpoint); craft drifts in +x (no
#      position hold) but altitude & attitude stay bounded.
#   J: motor 0 at 70% unbalances the quad; the mixer raises the other motors and the
#      attitude loop keeps tilt bounded (no flip), altitude held. Motor duties stay < 1
#      (G4: no sustained saturation).
# 期待: F で下向き風により高度が一瞬沈むが ALT_HOLD が推力を上げ保持（数 cm 以内に復帰）、
#   水平は +x にドリフト（位置保持なし）だが高度・姿勢は有界。J でモータ0=70% の不均衡を
#   ミキサーが他モータ増で補償し傾きは有界（転倒なし）、高度保持、duty<1（G4 飽和なし）。
